{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_01_end","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_01","title":"埋藏","storyCode":"DM-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"7f5a92e9bc7012db951ab82750569632e92643753f71d739c56add92c2482541","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"数个月后\n4:28  P.M.    天气/多云\n卡兹戴尔东西部战场，军事缓冲区边缘"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小小的伏击。\n看来和你说的一样，的确有不少人盯着我的脑袋，真是头疼。\n敌军人数很少，是打算迅速斩首撤离吧。\n毕竟我们只有半支负责扫荡的小队，这的确是个千载难逢的机会，干掉我的机会。\n......但是很可惜，这个“机会”是我故意留给他们的。\n好了，回头见，去卡兹戴尔的信使就快回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在找什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这具尸体......是刚才的刺客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"——有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道他会带在身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......纸条？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，比起这个，你认识这个刺客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"刺客，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有过合作，出生入死，几个月前我们还在疤痕商场欢庆过共同的胜利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"他当时甚至还说，他愿意把他的女儿嫁给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"听着真蠢，既然都是雇佣兵，迟早不都会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，你总不能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我当然拒绝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......用别的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那上面写着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"值得关注的东西，行情，报价，总之你也应该了解一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"都是人名......不，是化名和代号，后面还画着......糖果？什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"糖果数量代表悬赏额，只有他自己在用的黑话，谁能从他这儿拿到最多的糖果，谁就是最炙手可热的队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"恶趣味的记号，真让人恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过看上去金额不小，谁出钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"每当我们完成一桩合同，都会有人额外准备一笔钱，用来除掉我们，比如雇主自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"越强大的佣兵越昂贵，越昂贵的佣兵越危险，越危险的佣兵越该死，而没死成的佣兵......会更强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战争把我们逼上死路，也给了我们活下去的余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"听上去还挺合理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"就当是行规吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......“佣兵，化名赫德雷，十颗。手下很强，十五颗。算上交情，二十颗。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是挺会要价的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"“W，旧的那个，已经结算。新的这个，麻烦，十颗，视情况加价。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他们似乎对你评价很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是因为上个月我把那群军火贩子活埋在了树林里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......所以，我该高兴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"军火......我为什么不知道这件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"顺手为之罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"当你们劫掠拉特兰人的时候，有谁想过要挨个汇报吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"对嘛，一个道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这不算是任务的一部分，雇佣兵就没有必要时刻分享自己踢开了多少石子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......话说回来，原来我比那个“W”要强吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"很难用“强弱”来准确描述单兵的作战能力，对我而言，服从命令要更加重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，下次我会如实汇报的，这样总行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，那个“W”是个什么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......他啊，是个怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"他和我们共行了很长时间，一次比一次卖力，非常优秀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"他曾想靠战功成为我们的领袖，为了让所有人都给他庆祝生日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......生日？萨卡兹？过生日？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是真的生日......他还不至于那么怪胎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"他杀了一个拉特兰人，拿到了他的铳，大概他们之间有点故事，然后他就把那天定做了自己的生日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼......猎杀拉特兰人为乐的佣兵，也许我们还挺合得来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是漫长仇视的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，“为乐”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我乐在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"“W”的确是其中最积极的一份子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"平时总是没心没肺地笑，话里有话，似乎永远藏着什么阴谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但其实比谁都容易相信别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他抱着一个“执念”，偏执的人总会落入他人引导的陷阱，无论善意恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......听上去不就是蠢嘛，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你们本来就是同一类人，精于伪装，随心所欲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么觉得自己能猜透我的想法？还是说你和伊内丝一样有什么古怪的源石技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不是因为当时你也清楚，我们可以做到同归于尽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......非要嘴硬逞强这点，你倒是和伊内丝也挺像的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，回去见见我们的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"要下雨了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是我第一次看见她笑。和W一样的笑。\n给她一个伪装的借口，总好过她继续这样麻木的工作。\n我需要的是一个能确实开辟道路的雇佣兵，不是单纯的傀儡，这里从来不缺傀儡。\n从那一天起，W成为了W。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......但伊内丝说的对。\n是很荒唐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝，你应该待在军帐里，而不是在这里望着篝火发呆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看来从卡兹戴尔带回来的不是什么好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到信使回来之后的不安，他表面上很镇定，其实都快吓疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有你的表情，你别说你自以为藏得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么新麻烦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，虽然我还活着，但是......我们的中介人死了，在卡兹戴尔的工业区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"他的尸体被丢在锻炉里，头融化了，那条扎眼的红色裤子倒是没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"谁干的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"没人知道什么时候下的手，锅炉工最先发现的尸体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但对方没有太多时间，在金属上留下的打斗痕迹没那么容易被消除——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"是个耍刀的，削铁如泥的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，反正也抓不到凶手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"想要死守自己在卡兹戴尔的温床却又不愿意被人摆布，下场迟早会如此可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"可付钱的人没了，这一点也不可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是接下来要说的事更不可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的信使在确认情报后撤离卡兹戴尔，途中接触到了一些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"一些......谍报人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"而且准确来说，不是“接触”，是被“拦截”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以我们又被抓住把柄了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是第一次了，我们大可以先下手为强......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这次看上去我们别无选择。信使接到了一道命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......命令？对我们？谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可不是什么听命行事的奴隶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的判断，你听我说完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要转移到战场之外，走一条偏僻的山道，可能要通过峡谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......去保护一支运输队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"运输护卫，真是古典的工作，不会那么简单吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉。这一次已经超出了我能掌握的范畴——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但我相信这是我们为数不多的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"如今整支队伍都落在我们的手上，局势在变化，其他人都在等待机会，我们不能这样坐以待毙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事，你和W负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......我暂且，按下别的疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我拒绝和W同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她的名声已经不小了，但我觉得她还没有准备好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"她做得很出色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看见你看不见的东西，我相信自己的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷的手下多出了一位爆破专家，神不知鬼不觉地把战场化为火海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"其他队伍非常警惕这件事，毕竟“战场”的具体范围每天都在变化，也许明天就是他们的大本营。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"她心里真的什么都没想，不管是杀人还是欺骗。她是个过于“合格”的雇佣兵了，我看不出她的深浅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想腹背受敌，更不觉得她能胜任“护卫”工作，你也不该在这个时候随便动用这个万众瞩目的新人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说你有什么别的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我......只能利用起该利用起的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"事情发展到今天，已经没有人能置身事外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵没有立场，但没有立场意味着没有归属。等到尘埃落定，我们都会和战争一并消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"但战争迟早有一天会卷土重来，我们只有一次活着的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心这样......也不该这样，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该抓住一切机会。找到我们的位置，不再随波逐流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......那支队伍从雷姆必拓抵达这里，极有可能进入卡兹戴尔势力范围后就遭到阻击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"现在营地里的很多人并不同意接受这项任务，队伍会经历一次变动，但是无关紧要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"这份合同很烫手，但是非常值得冒这个风险，我们、至少你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"先等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......我刚才没有质疑你的意思......我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，算了。其实你不用这么紧张，我听你的，一直都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你必须先冷静一点，看看自己的脚下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你在说我的影子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不到你眼里的光景，我怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"影子在晃动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......有风，篝火在闪烁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我在说什么，你们总是这样，萨卡兹都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"别总是想那么远，你操纵不了那么多事情，你我都只是个雇佣兵而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你让我带着W去，那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你盘算着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"只有少数人有必要知道真实的信息，并负担起这份风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你信不过其他队伍，至少该信任自己人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有在刻意隐瞒，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那就如实告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的信使到底遇到了什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......“巴别塔”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是巴别塔在卡兹戴尔留下的暗桩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
